<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=5.0, user-scalable=yes" />
    <title>MCP handshake probe API — Influzer.ai</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Public API: handshake a remote MCP URL. Returns tools/list count, auth gate, and live status — never a safe-to-install badge. Embed in CI, catalogs, and docs." />
    <link rel="canonical" href="<%= canonicalUrl %>" />
    <%- include('partials/seo-social', {
      ogTitle: 'MCP handshake probe API — Influzer.ai',
      ogDescription: 'GET /api/v1/probe?url=… — live tools/list facts for a remote MCP server. Not a SAFE badge.',
      ogUrl: canonicalUrl,
    }) %>
    <%- include('partials/favicon-links') %>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/home.css?v=<%= assetVersion %>" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/mcp-setup-page.css?v=<%= assetVersion %>" />
  </head>
  <body class="registry-page">
    <%- include('partials/home-header') %>

    <main class="setup-shell" id="main">
      <a class="setup-back" href="/mcp">← MCP directory</a>

      <p class="setup-eyebrow">Public API · Read-only · No auth</p>
      <h1 class="setup-title">Handshake probe</h1>
      <p class="setup-lead">
        Call a remote MCP URL the same way Influzer does in the catalog:
        <code>initialize</code> then <code>tools/list</code>.
        You get live status, tool count, and whether an auth gate answered —
        <strong>not a safe-to-install badge</strong>.
        Embed this in CI, internal catalogs, and README checks.
      </p>

      <div class="setup-endpoint">
        <p class="setup-endpoint__label">PROBE ENDPOINT</p>
        <div class="setup-endpoint__row">
          <code class="setup-endpoint__url" id="setupEndpoint"><%= endpoint %></code>
          <button type="button" class="setup-endpoint__copy" id="copyEndpoint">Copy URL</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <form class="probe-form" id="probeForm">
        <label class="probe-form__label" for="probeUrl">Remote MCP URL</label>
        <div class="probe-form__row">
          <input
            class="probe-form__input"
            id="probeUrl"
            name="url"
            type="url"
            required
            placeholder="https://www.influzer.ai/mcp/discovery"
            value="<%= discoveryEndpoint %>"
            autocomplete="off"
            spellcheck="false"
          />
          <button type="submit" class="probe-form__submit" id="probeSubmit">Probe</button>
        </div>
        <p class="setup-note">HTTPS only. Private, localhost, and credentialed URLs are rejected.</p>
      </form>

      <pre class="setup-code probe-result" id="probeResult" hidden><code></code></pre>
      <p class="probe-status" id="probeStatus" hidden></p>

      <h2 class="setup-prompts__title">curl</h2>
      <pre class="setup-code"><code>curl -sS "<%= endpoint %>?url=https://www.influzer.ai/mcp/discovery"</code></pre>

      <h2 class="setup-prompts__title">CI check</h2>
      <pre class="setup-code"><code>STATUS=$(curl -sS "<%= endpoint %>?url=$MCP_URL" | jq -r .live_status)
# live_ok or auth_required are handshakes. unreachable is a ticket.
test "$STATUS" != "unreachable"</code></pre>

      <h2 class="setup-prompts__title">README badge</h2>
      <p class="setup-note">Shields-style SVG from the catalog overlay clock (warm / seed / last handshake). Live-probes only when that is missing so README and listing cannot disagree. JSON <code>/probe</code> stays on-demand live. Indigo <code>live_ok</code>, amber <code>auth_required</code>, gray <code>unreachable</code>. Cached ~10 minutes. Never a SAFE badge. Stdio has no badge.</p>
      <p class="setup-note"><img alt="MCP handshake" src="/api/v1/probe/badge?slug=influzer-mcp-discovery" height="20" /></p>
      <pre class="setup-code"><code>[![MCP handshake](<%= endpoint %>/badge?url=https://www.influzer.ai/mcp/discovery)](<%= canonicalUrl %>?url=https://www.influzer.ai/mcp/discovery)</code></pre>
      <pre class="setup-code"><code>curl -sS "<%= endpoint %>/badge?slug=influzer-mcp-discovery"</code></pre>

      <h2 class="setup-prompts__title">GitHub Action on mcp.json</h2>
      <p class="setup-note">Handshake every HTTPS URL in Cursor/VS Code <code>mcp.json</code>. Stdio entries are skipped. Not a SAFE badge.</p>
      <pre class="setup-code"><code>- uses: rmencke2/logo/.github/actions/probe-mcp-json@main
  with:
    file: .cursor/mcp.json</code></pre>
      <pre class="setup-code"><code>node scripts/probe-mcp-json.js --file .cursor/mcp.json</code></pre>

      <h2 class="setup-prompts__title">What you get</h2>
      <ul class="setup-steps probe-facts">
        <li class="setup-step"><span class="setup-step__num" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span><code>live_status</code> — <code>live_ok</code>, <code>auth_required</code>, or <code>unreachable</code></span></li>
        <li class="setup-step"><span class="setup-step__num" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span><code>auth_gate</code> — 401/403 seen vs none detected</span></li>
        <li class="setup-step"><span class="setup-step__num" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span><code>tool_count</code> + tool names from live <code>tools/list</code></span></li>
        <li class="setup-step"><span class="setup-step__num" aria-hidden="true">4</span><span><code>catalog</code> — Influzer listings that already use this URL</span></li>
        <li class="setup-step"><span class="setup-step__num" aria-hidden="true">5</span><span><code>safety_badge</code> is always <code>null</code></span></li>
      </ul>

      <p class="setup-links">
        <a href="/mcp/discovery/setup">MCP Discovery</a>
        · <a href="/mcp/discovery/skill">Agent skill</a>
        · <a href="/insights/not-safe-just-honest-mcp-quality-layer-for-the-long-tail">Not “safe” — just honest</a>
        · <a href="/mcp/scoreboard">Handshake scoreboard</a>
        · <a href="/mcp">Browse Top 100</a>
      </p>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/registry-footer') %>

    <script src="/js/registry.js?v=<%= assetVersion %>" defer></script>
    <script src="/js/mcp-setup-page.js?v=<%= assetVersion %>" defer></script>
    <script src="/js/mcp-probe-page.js?v=<%= assetVersion %>" defer></script>
  </body>
</html>
